go together (since I couldn&#039;t see it beforehand) but I like the way the grey pairs with the coral! That way he&#039;ll match the bridesmaids :)&amp;nbsp; And yes, kitty was very interested! haha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899056,"PostDate":1435003740,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you!! I was scared it wouldn't go together (since I couldn't see it beforehand) but I like the way the grey pairs with the coral! That way he'll match the bridesmaids <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 And yes, kitty was very interested! haha<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424114250,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1435126196","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.141.11.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79243,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"369e022b1a1bb86801b435b78e3793ae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"KatieMcBride\"] which pants style did you end up going with?&lt;\/p&gt;","At